</figure>
<div id="S5.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Results on the MedQA dataset are summarized in Table <a href="#S5.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 5 Results ‣ Brittleness and Promise: Knowledge Graph–Based Reward Modeling for Diagnostic Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>. For this evaluation, we also trained task-specific models as baseline. Notably, for Qwen2.5-7B and Qwen3-8B, our training strategies show modest improvements over the baseline models.</p>
</div>
